From 833452f9199c9f93c02a98f737d8ce4a29349163 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: g1-door <g1-door@local>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 11:42:59 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] door: optional script teacher that runs the real robot door
 script per env and writes the arm accumulator (env.config.script_teacher: for
 the first frac of the envs a ScriptDoor state machine and the damped least
 squares arm IK from G1_Hackason/Door/real are stepped every control step with
 the pelvis pose in the door frame and the joints in SDK order, the 7 arm
 targets are written back into the delta action accumulator, the other arm
 columns hold the last value and the walk columns are zeroed so that the
 policy output does not reach the arms or legs, per episode results go to a
 JSON lines file and optional traces; used on 11-12 to check that the script
 that opened the real door to 10 deg behaves the same in sim; default off =
 unchanged) (11-12)

---
 gr00t/rl/envs/door/door_open_homie.py |  10 ++
 gr00t/rl/envs/door/script_teacher.py  | 196 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 206 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 gr00t/rl/envs/door/script_teacher.py

